Mic Board Left Schematic (textual): mic_board_left.kicad_sch

Component:
- U1: LMA3729T MEMS microphone (PDM output)
- C1: 0.1uF decoupling near VDD
- J1: PDM connector 4-pin (VDD, GND, PDM_CLK, PDM_DATA)

Notes:
- LMA3729T recommended layout: keep small ground pour and quiet analog ground
- Orientation: microphone acoustic port to face desired sound source

Netlist:
- VDD -> 3V3
- GND -> GND
- PDM_DATA -> PDM_DATA pin to main board
- PDM_CLK -> PDM_CLK pin to main board
